","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":404,"digest":"sha256:a1068cdd796a536e0b341cb80e183ecda5f0e5a2b2ab229317025fcc69f362a2","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-16T22:31:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T22:31:36Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/ysya/lunport/releases/download/v1.1.0/Lunport_universal.app.tar.gz.sig"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ysya/lunport/tarball/v1.1.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ysya/lunport/zipball/v1.1.0","body":"## [1.1.0](https://github.com/ysya/lunport/compare/v1.0.0...v1.1.0) (2026-10-16)\n\n\nLunport is the new name for SSHelter, with a simple Folded L mark, consistent About and Settings branding, and refreshed product documentation. Existing hosts, keys, sync data, credentials and command-line integrations retain their established identities. Windows runtime ownership is repaired to prevent intermittent native cleanup crashes.\n\n### Features\n\n* complete Lunport About and product documentation ([e977a03](https://github.com/ysya/lunport/commit/e977a03317a90a5203e00bc572bb61f4207348ef))\n* rebrand app as Lunport with Folded L icons ([e83e658](https://github.com/ysya/lunport/commit/e83e6580e05fdc56e8425d10959c49791529dbf6))\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **windows:** prevent concurrent runtime handle ownership races ([d54853a](https://github.com/ysya/lunport/commit/d54853a08cf0a07d6c450ccc25db393b4e1712dc))"}